## Project Objectives

Development of an AI-powered enterprise cybersecurity platform providing threat detection, incident response, and compliance management for Fortune 500 companies.

### Key Deliverables
1. Threat detection engine (AI-powered)
2. Security operations center (SOC) platform
3. Incident response automation
4. Compliance dashboard
5. Threat intelligence feed

